      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1), by substituting for the word “forthwith” the words “as soon as reasonably practicable”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_11__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (3) the following subsection: “(3) The notice issued under subsection (1) shall— (a) contain the following particulars: (i) the date, time and location of the offence; (ii) the offence committed; (iii) a recorded image of the motor vehicle’s registration number plate; (iv) a recorded image of the motor vehicle; and (v) an offer to compound or a request to appear in court; and (b) be digitally signed by the issuing authority.”. Amendment of section 54"
      }
    },
    {
