      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Road Transport Act 1987 [Act 333], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in section 2—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 115A(1) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the word “forthwith” the words “as soon as reasonably practicable”. Amendment of section 118"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_21",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "21",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 118 of the principal Act is amended in the shoulder note by deleting the words “and signature”. Amendment of Second Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_22",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "22",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Second Schedule to the principal Act is amended by substituting for paragraph (iii) the following paragraph: “(iii) Subject to section 76A, failing to obey a red signal at the traffic sign”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “driving licence” the following definition: ‘ “electric bicycle” means cycles with pedal assistance which are equipped with an auxiliary electric motor having a maximum continuous rated power of 0.25 kW, of which the output is progressively reduced and finally cut off as the vehicle reaches a speed of 25 km/h or sooner if the cyclist stops pedalling;’;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the English language text in the definition of “electronic motor vehicle”, by substituting for the word “electronic” the word “electric”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of “traffic”, by inserting after the words “bicycles,” the words “electric bicycles,”. Amendment of section 5"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_3__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_3__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 5(1) of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (a), by inserting after the words “three thousand” the words “five hundred”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (e), by substituting for the words “exceeds three thousand” the words “does not exceed three thousand five hundred”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_3__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (f), by inserting after the words “three thousand” the words “five hundred”. Amendment of section 14"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 14(4) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words “be liable to a fine” the words “of not less than three hundred ringgit and”. Amendment of section 15"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 15(4) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “not exceeding” the words “of not less than three hundred ringgit and not more than”. Amendment of section 17"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 17(1) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after paragraph (bb) the following paragraph: “(bc) in relation to a class or category of motor vehicles required to undergo periodic inspection under Part IIA, the inspection certificate issued under section 66C is produced;”. Amendment of section 26"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 26(2) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “not exceeding one thousand” the words “of not less than three hundred ringgit and not more than two thousand”. Amendment of section 35"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 35(8) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “section 119” the words “section 53, 53A, 115A or 119, as the case may be, unless criminal proceedings have been instituted for that offence”. Amendment of section 35A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/29/eng@/~cl_9",
